	(text "Master on/off: front-panel illuminated rocker (SPST, 12 V lamp between LOAD and GND).\nCable unplugged or switch off -> EN pulled low -> VBUS off -> every output off,\nincluding the always-on Mimas/switch/fan group. The lamp lights from VIN_OR when on.\nJP1 bridges the switch for bench use."
