	(text "~VALIDn are open drain (low = input n valid). The selected input is the highest-priority\nvalid one, so LED2 = V2 & !V1, LED3 = V3 & !V1 & !V2. LEDs are dark when VBUS is off\n(master switch off). Q9-Q11 gates see at most 3.3 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
